sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Admin Portal
    participant Api as AdminGoogleCalendarSyncController
    participant Ops as GoogleCalendarSyncOperationsService
    participant Repo as ServiceAppointmentCalendarSyncRepository
    participant Worker as GoogleCalendarSyncRetryWorker
    participant GCal as IGoogleCalendarService

    Admin->>Api: GET /api/admin/google-calendar-sync/overview
    Api->>Ops: GetOverviewAsync(fromUtc,toUtc)
    Ops->>Repo: QueryForReprocessAsync(...)
    Repo-->>Ops: itens de sync
    Ops-->>Api: resumo por status e latencia
    Api-->>Admin: 200 overview

    Worker->>Ops: ProcessDueRetriesAsync(batchSize)
    Ops->>Repo: GetRetryDueAsync(nowUtc,batchSize)
    Repo-->>Ops: fila due
    loop para cada item
        Ops->>GCal: create update ou delete
        alt sucesso
            Ops->>Repo: UpdateAsync(Synced Deleted, limpar retry)
        else falha retryable
            Ops->>Repo: UpdateAsync(Failed, NextRetryAtUtc, RetryCount++)
        else falha permanente
            Ops->>Repo: UpdateAsync(DeadLetter, DeadLetterAtUtc, LastErrorCode)
        end
    end

    Admin->>Api: POST /api/admin/google-calendar-sync/reprocess
    Api->>Ops: ReprocessAsync(request)
    Ops->>Repo: QueryForReprocessAsync(appointmentId intervalo status)
    Repo-->>Ops: itens filtrados
    loop para cada item
        Ops->>GCal: create update ou delete
        Ops->>Repo: UpdateAsync(resultado final)
    end
    Ops-->>Api: resultado item a item
    Api-->>Admin: 200 reprocess
